        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="baseline" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"><em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. The system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Required forms for your appointment</span></p>
<p>Please, print and fill-out the attached forms. You will need them for your appointment.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Questions or cancellation? Please contact the health and wellness team at <a title="healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca" href="mailto:healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca">healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca</a> or by calling (613) 943-5555.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><a name="francais"></a><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Formulaires requis pour votre rendez-vous</span></p>
<p>Veuillez imprimer et remplir les formulaires inclut dans le pr&eacute;sent courriel. Vous en aurez besoin lors de votre rendez-vous.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Question ou annulation? Veuillez communiquer avec l'&eacute;quipe de sant&eacute; et mieux-&ecirc;tre &agrave; <a title="healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca" href="mailto:healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca">healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca</a> ou en composant le (613) 943-5555</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
